    {
      "id": "Ahyp247dI5Giwp2dkRKvf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 184.69631867550635,
      "y": -113.57723282052942,
      "width": 601.5410650059266,
      "height": 321.6799886947904,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 424023482,
      "version": 204,
      "versionNonce": 625515258,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789056028512,
      "created": 1789054196629,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Read-heavy / caching\nWrite-heavy / ingestion\nPartitioning, sharding & hotspot handling\nReplication, consistency & quorum\nEvent-driven / messaging / stream processing\nFanout / aggregation / feed generation\nSearch & indexing\nObject/blob storage, CDN & media delivery\nReal-time communication / WebSockets / presence\nWorkflow / scheduling / async jobs\nTransactions / payments / inventory / reservations\nDistributed coordination / locking / leader election / consensus\nGeospatial / proximity / location tracking\nAnalytics / batch / streaming data pipelines\nMulti-region / HA / DR / global routing\nMulti-tenancy / rate limiting / quotas / backpressure / overload control",
      "fontSize": 16.083999434739518,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Read-heavy / caching\nWrite-heavy / ingestion\nPartitioning, sharding & hotspot handling\nReplication, consistency & quorum\nEvent-driven / messaging / stream processing\nFanout / aggregation / feed generation\nSearch & indexing\nObject/blob storage, CDN & media delivery\nReal-time communication / WebSockets / presence\nWorkflow / scheduling / async jobs\nTransactions / payments / inventory / reservations\nDistributed coordination / locking / leader election / consensus\nGeospatial / proximity / location tracking\nAnalytics / batch / streaming data pipelines\nMulti-region / HA / DR / global routing\nMulti-tenancy / rate limiting / quotas / backpressure / overload control",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ysgrqqPcnkFBgnikabQTV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -85.0376752121511,
      "y": 238.56428308148617,
      "width": 948.8794555664062,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 904298170,
      "version": 206,
      "versionNonce": 1157993254,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789057527955,
      "created": 1789057427482,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Priority          | Pattern                                              | Why                                                    |\n| ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **P0**           | **Fanout / aggregation / feed generation** | Constructing each user's personalized feed             |\n| **P0**           | **Read-heavy / caching**                        | Billions of feed reads                                 |\n| **P0**           | **Partitioning / sharding / hotspots**       | Users, feeds, graph and celebrity accounts             |\n| **P0**           | **Event-driven / stream processing**         | Post → fanout → ranking → notification pipelines       |\n| **P0**           | **Consistency / replication**                   | Social graph, posts, feed freshness                    |\n| **P1**            | **Write-heavy / ingestion**                    | Posts, reactions, comments and graph changes           |\n| **P1**            | **Multi-region / HA / DR**                     | Global service availability                            |\n| **P1**            | **Backpressure / overload control**         | Viral posts and celebrity accounts                     |\n| **P1**            | **Object storage / CDN**                     | Photos/videos attached to feed posts                   |\n| **P1**            | **Analytics / streaming pipelines**           | Ranking signals and engagement analytics               |\n| **P1**            | **Search/indexing**                        | Secondary capability, not the fundamental feed problem |\n| **P2**           | Workflow / async jobs                      | Reprocessing, ranking, moderation, repair              |\n| **P2**           | Distributed coordination                   | Shard/worker coordination, elections, etc.             |\n| **P2**           | Multi-tenancy/rate limiting                | Abuse prevention and protection                        |\n| **Not central** | Real-time communication                    | Messenger/Chat is a different primary problem          |\n| **Not central** | Geospatial                                 | Not fundamental to the feed                            |\n| **Not central** | Transactions/payments                      | Not fundamental to News Feed                           |\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Priority          | Pattern                                              | Why                                                    |\n| ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **P0**           | **Fanout / aggregation / feed generation** | Constructing each user's personalized feed             |\n| **P0**           | **Read-heavy / caching**                        | Billions of feed reads                                 |\n| **P0**           | **Partitioning / sharding / hotspots**       | Users, feeds, graph and celebrity accounts             |\n| **P0**           | **Event-driven / stream processing**         | Post → fanout → ranking → notification pipelines       |\n| **P0**           | **Consistency / replication**                   | Social graph, posts, feed freshness                    |\n| **P1**            | **Write-heavy / ingestion**                    | Posts, reactions, comments and graph changes           |\n| **P1**            | **Multi-region / HA / DR**                     | Global service availability                            |\n| **P1**            | **Backpressure / overload control**         | Viral posts and celebrity accounts                     |\n| **P1**            | **Object storage / CDN**                     | Photos/videos attached to feed posts                   |\n| **P1**            | **Analytics / streaming pipelines**           | Ranking signals and engagement analytics               |\n| **P1**            | **Search/indexing**                        | Secondary capability, not the fundamental feed problem |\n| **P2**           | Workflow / async jobs                      | Reprocessing, ranking, moderation, repair              |\n| **P2**           | Distributed coordination                   | Shard/worker coordination, elections, etc.             |\n| **P2**           | Multi-tenancy/rate limiting                | Abuse prevention and protection                        |\n| **Not central** | Real-time communication                    | Messenger/Chat is a different primary problem          |\n| **Not central** | Geospatial                                 | Not fundamental to the feed                            |\n| **Not central** | Transactions/payments                      | Not fundamental to News Feed                           |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ivKgNg5aC2tq6Q5BsqlDX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 966.0693098902973,
      "y": 252.0450641355917,
      "width": 277.73980712890625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
