      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "RzKAGlUEsX-bzuaeuPNnW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 962.8845726551888,
      "y": 287.1383621417168,
      "width": 704.9754028320312,
      "height": 420,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 649466726,
      "version": 760,
      "versionNonce": 1556589946,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789060796424,
      "created": 1789057904573,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Availability: 99.99% feed-read availability\n\nA temporary inability to display the perfect personalized feed is preferable\nto taking the entire feed offline\n\nLatency: \np50: <100ms\np95: <200ms\np99: <500ms\n\nThis assumes the majority of content is already cached/materialized\n\nConsistency: do not require global strong consistency\nUser Authentication: strong\nPost Create/Edit/Delete: strong within owning write path\nPrivacy ACL: Strong enough to prevent unauthroized access\nSocial relationship: strong/ read-your-writes preferred\n\nEventual :\nFeed membership, Feed ordering, Like count, comment count, ranking features and analytics\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Availability: 99.99% feed-read availability\n\nA temporary inability to display the perfect personalized feed is preferable\nto taking the entire feed offline\n\nLatency: \np50: <100ms\np95: <200ms\np99: <500ms\n\nThis assumes the majority of content is already cached/materialized\n\nConsistency: do not require global strong consistency\nUser Authentication: strong\nPost Create/Edit/Delete: strong within owning write path\nPrivacy ACL: Strong enough to prevent unauthroized access\nSocial relationship: strong/ read-your-writes preferred\n\nEventual :\nFeed membership, Feed ordering, Like count, comment count, ranking features and analytics\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "m3zX10EHJSTUwvs5xYMA1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 966.0559412799938,
      "y": 729.4914727636,
      "width": 977.4237060546875,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
