    {
      "id": "SmfD-z80q5aaDqSaAxQpY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1723.5970709124013,
      "y": 357.42299938056084,
      "width": 293.7437744140625,
      "height": 240,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1675119802,
      "version": 527,
      "versionNonce": 1266863098,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789060829260,
      "created": 1789059825437,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "100M posts/day\naverage 200 followers\nFanout: 20B Feed entries\n\n~232K feed-entry writes/sec\nAt peak 5x: 1M feed entry writes/sec\n\nConsidering a celebrity posting:\n100M followers x 1post\nfanout operations = 100M\n\nDANGEROUS / SCALING PROBLEM",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "100M posts/day\naverage 200 followers\nFanout: 20B Feed entries\n\n~232K feed-entry writes/sec\nAt peak 5x: 1M feed entry writes/sec\n\nConsidering a celebrity posting:\n100M followers x 1post\nfanout operations = 100M\n\nDANGEROUS / SCALING PROBLEM",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "G2vMfNa0IhQ2GhpKTNEm-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2091.438310327273,
      "y": -98.05973592465273,
      "width": 340.4957275390625,
      "height": 360,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 311303206,
      "version": 429,
      "versionNonce": 1621257530,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789060823885,
      "created": 1789060032879,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Storage:\nPer post 2KB\n~ 200 GB/day\n~ 73 TB/year\n\nWith replication 3x: 220+ TB per year\n\nFor metadata of posts only\n\nFEED Storage:\nin naive-approach (fanout per follower)\n\n(100M per average 200 followers)\n20B Feed entries * 50 bytes\n\n~960 GB/day\n~350 TB/year (before replication/indexing)\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Storage:\nPer post 2KB\n~ 200 GB/day\n~ 73 TB/year\n\nWith replication 3x: 220+ TB per year\n\nFor metadata of posts only\n\nFEED Storage:\nin naive-approach (fanout per follower)\n\n(100M per average 200 followers)\n20B Feed entries * 50 bytes\n\n~960 GB/day\n~350 TB/year (before replication/indexing)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "DGBvRZo89MCn-qW7LiCdp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2089.417927073811,
      "y": 272.6181230766549,
      "width": 525.7275390625,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 729481830,
      "version": 216,
      "versionNonce": 463503610,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789060825099,
      "created": 1789060320408,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Fanout-on-write moves work from the read path to the write path,\nbut dramatically increase storage and write amplification",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Fanout-on-write moves work from the read path to the write path,\nbut dramatically increase storage and write amplification",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
